  "description": "A fast, self-contained .NET 8 logger that persists entries to compact binary, time-indexed files for near-instant time-range queries. Writes human-readable console lines synchronously, drains to disk on a background writer, supports in-process live streaming, and ships an optional embedded HTML log viewer. Fails soft when no writable log path is available.",
